From: shikosu <teovidal01@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:36:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64_survey: a read-only survey of a module's AArch64 code,
 on a synthetic fixture

Lists each unwind-described function's direct and indirect branches, calls, svc,
tpidr/x18 uses and the SDK's `svc #n; ret` wrappers; a word that does not decode
inside a function is an explicit SurveyError (address, word, function). The fixture
(tests/arm64_fixture.py) assembles a tiny NSO word by word: no game data.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: first step of an AArch64 -> x86_64 recompilation (NX2Linux); tooling and tests only, nothing in the host or the shader chain changes

Issue: none yet (NX2Linux, branch feat/teo-recompilation-arm64)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
